Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 11:51:57 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 084/158] Unified: design check finds drawing dimensions that
 lost their geometry

TechDraw dimensions whose edge or vertex is gone keep showing an old
value (or silently stop drawing). Expose DrawViewDimension
getReferenceState() ("ok", "broken", "unknown") to Python and report
broken dimensions and drawing views whose source part was deleted.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
