 .../TechDraw/App/DrawViewDimensionPyImp.cpp   | 23 ++++++++++++
 src/Mod/Unified/DesignCheck.py                | 35 ++++++++++++++++++-
 src/Mod/Unified/DesignCheckGui.py             |  2 +-
 .../Gui/Resources/translations/Unified_ja.ts  | 20 +++++++++--
 5 files changed, 80 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

